    <section id="status" aria-labelledby="status-heading">
      <h2 id="status-heading">Status and collaboration</h2>
      <p>AI tools were used extensively in developing, writing, reproducing and reviewing this work. The preprint is unrefereed. Internal AI-assisted reviews are not external human peer review, journal acceptance or proof-assistant certification.</p>
